OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785331108
OL,3,CMaternity unit set to close
OL,4,Ctemporarily due to staffing levels
OL,6,FThe maternity unit at North Devon
OL,7,FDistrict Hospital will be temporarily
OL,8,Fclosing from next month.
OL,10,FThe decision comes following a review
OL,11,Fof medical staffing levels, which
OL,12,Ffound the unit couldn't safely remain
OL,13,Fopen.
OL,15,FIn a statement, the Royal Devon
OL,16,FUniversity Healthcare NHS Foundation
OL,17,FTrust said: "We cannot guarantee that
OL,18,Fwomen would consistently have access
OL,19,Fto the level of senior medical support
OL,20,Fduring labour they may require.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785331108
OL,3,CMaternity unit set to close
OL,4,Ctemporarily due to staffing levels
OL,6,F"For this reason, the Royal Devon has
OL,7,Ftaken the difficult decision to begin
OL,8,Fplanning for the temporary suspension
OL,9,Fof births at North Devon District
OL,10,FHospital from Tuesday 11 August 2026."
OL,12,FIt also added: "Between now and then,
OL,13,Fthe Trust will continue to explore
OL,14,Fevery available opportunity to avoid
OL,15,Fsuspending the service, working
OL,16,Fclosely with neighbouring providers,
OL,17,FNHS Devon Integrated Care Board and
OL,18,FNHS England South West."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785331108
OL,3,CMaternity unit set to close
OL,4,Ctemporarily due to staffing levels
OL,6,FThe trust says that it is short of
OL,7,Fconsultants by up to 50% and middle-
OL,8,Ftier doctors by 40% due to a range of
OL,9,Freasons. These include staff leaving
OL,10,Fthe hospital, staff maternity leave,
OL,11,Fstaff sickness and short-notice locum
OL,12,Funavailability.
OL,14,FThe Royal Devon Chief Medical Officer,
OL,15,FVanessa Purday, said: "This is an
OL,16,Fenormous decision and one we feel the
OL,17,Fweight of in our community."
OL,19,FAround 12,000 babies are born at the
OL,20,Fmaternity unit every year.
OL,26,@wD@WOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785331108
OL,3,CMaternity unit set to close
OL,4,Ctemporarily due to staffing levels
OL,6,FVanessa added "We are extremely
OL,7,Fconcerned about our maternity
OL,8,Fconsultant and medical cover at North
OL,9,FDevon District Hospital (NDDH).
OL,11,F"The service at NDDH has been reliant
OL,12,Fon locum and agency cover for some
OL,13,Ftime and recent additional staffing
OL,14,Fshortages and absence have tipped the
OL,15,Fbalance into it being unsafe to
OL,16,Fcontinue beyond 11 August.
OL,26,@nD@OOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785331108
OL,3,CMaternity unit set to close
OL,4,Ctemporarily due to staffing levels
OL,6,F"Our maternity teams have worked so
OL,7,Fhard and held this service together
OL,8,Ffor many months, working extra and
OL,9,Flonger hours to ensure our families
OL,10,Fgot the care they needed. However,
OL,11,Fdespite our best efforts we cannot
OL,12,Fstaff our medical rota in August.
OL,14,F"A key priority now is ensuring that
OL,15,Fthose women and families who are due
OL,16,Fto give birth receive timely, accurate
OL,17,Finformation about their options, and
OL,18,Fare fully supported to make choices
OL,19,Fthat are right for them. We don't have
OL,20,Fall that detail yet but will be
OL,21,Fissuing it as soon as we can."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU}D@^O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
