FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785331108
OL,3,CMaternity unit set to close
OL,4,Ctemporarily due to staffing levels
OL,6,FThe trust says it will contact their
OL,7,Fpatients in order of delivery date to
OL,8,Fdiscuss future plans and ensure
OL,9,Fsupport is available.
OL,11,FIt's not yet known where expectant
OL,12,Fparents will be transferred following
OL,13,Fthe closure.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
